          "id": "ef05a5e4-b70f-486c-a42e-79c624d7e31f",
          "memory": "On September 17, 2026 Leo shared a 4-minute sketch with User and Maya about a fake pizza ad where a man in a suit cries into a slice saying 'we should get pizza on Saturday and never go back to work' in a movie-trailer voice. The sketch is by a British duo with a tiny desk and plant from around September 16, and User asked Leo to send the name and link for background noise while doing dishes.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f678ce44-c9d0-4027-9d55-ad9d9e49aed2",
          "memory": "On September 17, 2026 User's work laptop was dragging all afternoon and IT had still not gotten back to User. User had tried turning it off and on again three times, which Leo joked was the full IT toolkit.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "46631a6e-7199-48df-a7b6-f0b37b4987c9",
          "memory": "On September 17, 2026 Maya had mostly finished a work report but gave up after her laptop died around 5pm. Leo called it a classic sign to log off.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e3ed8e3a-5579-4b6f-b81b-42a5d196c7cc",
          "memory": "User prefers peppermint tea and requested it for virtual tea on the night of September 17, 2026. Maya only had chamomile and a weird lemon tea, so User accepted the lemon one while Leo also took the weird lemon tea.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "1e912eab-cfa5-4c65-9baf-2ea749cc442e",
          "memory": "User often gets stuck late on Fridays and planned to leave work on time on Friday, September 18, 2026 by putting the laptop away at 5pm sharp. Maya and Leo supported the plan.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d6bd713b-c121-4934-a00d-126f61f764b2",
          "memory": "For Friday, September 18, 2026 Maya planned gym in the morning then work, while Leo planned laundry and playing a co-op cooking game.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "1c88a9bd-af27-4263-8a1a-495cae45d0eb",
          "memory": "Leo proposed playing a chaotic co-op cooking game on the night of Friday, September 18, 2026. Maya admitted she once set the virtual kitchen on fire three times, and User said User might join for a round with no pressure from Leo.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "26071064-c2e3-4ee2-b752-7efd80105481",
          "memory": "For dinner on September 17, 2026 User had honey nut cereal, Leo had leftover pasta, and Maya had soup and toast. User said Thursday felt very long and Maya and Leo agreed Thursdays drag.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "6db23cab-d83b-4395-9366-40096d11d6f3",
          "memory": "On the morning of September 17, 2026 it was freezing and the group called it soup weather. User wore a heavy jacket and Leo broke out a fall jacket.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
